	(text_box "LCD interface\n\nDesigned for max 800x480 similar to this:\nhttps://www.buydisplay.com/ips-5-tft-lcd-display-module-wvga-800x480-high-resolution-for-mp4-gps\n\n\nRESISTOR DIVIDER AND VOUT\n\nVout = 1.25 * (1 + (R32 / R7))\n\nFor 18V:\nR32   = 68.34k (appx)\nR7 = 5.1k\n\n56k/5.1k = 15V\n56k/4.7k = 16.14V <======\n100k/5.62k = 23.5V\n\n\n\nPOWER\nIo power: 3.3V 200mA max = 0.6W\nMax backlight power: 45mA x 18V = 0.81W\n + AP3012 inefficiency (81%) 0.2W\nTotal = 1.6W max\n\n\n\nConnect AP3012 to USB VSYS and 3.3v in with a solder jumper selector. \nSHDN pin should connect to a GPIO that defaults to high-Z or low or drain. Min 1.5V to be 'ON' so 1.8V gpio\nEIM_WAIT defaults to input on boot with 100k PU, defaulting to OFF"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 20.32 0)
		(size 88.9 66.04)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e21f4ab0-ba37-482d-89ec-29f50dad618f")
	)
